  "body": "**Link to problem area**: https://spec.matrix.org/v1.7/client-server-api/#put_matrixmediav3uploadservernamemediaid\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\nThe spec claims that the `PUT /_matrix/media/v3/upload/{serverName}/{mediaId}` endpoint doesn't require authentication:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/assets/720821/978784e3-498d-4907-ac93-4cd8776f2144)\r\n\r\n\r\n**Expected behaviour**\r\n[MSC2246](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/blob/main/proposals/2246-asynchronous-uploads.md#put-_matrixmediav3uploadservernamemediaid) claims that “[...] This endpoint requires auth”.",
